% roastery, zoxide, navigation

# Jump to frecent directory - z <query>
z <query>

# Jump interactively with fzf - zi
zi

# Add current directory to database - zoxide add .
zoxide add .

# Remove directory from database - zoxide remove <path>
zoxide remove <path>

# Query the database - zoxide query <query>
zoxide query <query>

# Show zoxide database entries - zoxide query -l
zoxide query -l
